---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Scavland 10 Factions & Reputation Guide — Scavland Wiki" description="Detailed guide to all 10 factions in Scavland: faction territories, vendor inventories, reputation mechanics, hostile triggers, and contract rewards in Zalesye." keywords="Scavland factions, wasteland factions, reputation system, faction vendors, Gunner faction, Mudlark faction, Scavland wiki" canonical="/factions/">
  <article class="article-shell">
    <header class="article-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">Faction Directory · Updated August 31, 2026</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">10 Factions &amp; Reputation</h1>
      <p class="lede">Complete directory of all 10 survivor organizations competing for dominance across Zalesye: territories, specialized merchants, alignment conflicts, and contract jobs.</p>
      <span class="evidence">Evidence: Official Verified Baseline</span>
    </header>

    <div class="article-layout">
      <div class="article-content">
        <div class="media-strip" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin:0 0 24px;">
          <figure style="margin:0;">
            <img src="/images/screenshots/steam_ss_04.webp" alt="Neutral settlement safehouse and faction outpost in Scavland" style="width:100%;height:180px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid var(--line);object-fit:cover;" loading="lazy"/>
            <figcaption class="caption">Neutral survivor settlement safehouse and trading stalls</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure style="margin:0;">
            <img src="/images/screenshots/steam_ss_13.webp" alt="Armed faction checkpoint in Zalesye" style="width:100%;height:180px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid var(--line);object-fit:cover;" loading="lazy"/>
            <figcaption class="caption">Fortified checkpoint manned by armed faction sentries</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>

        <div class="quick-answer" style="margin-bottom:32px;">
          <strong>Reputation Dynamics &amp; Vendor Standings</strong>
          In Scavland, neutrality is hard to maintain. Assisting one faction by completing high-risk contracts or turning in recovered Soviet technology will increase your loyalty tier with that group while antagonizing their rivals.
        </div>

        <h2 id="directory">Major Factions Directory</h2>

        <div style="overflow-x:auto;margin:20px 0;">
          <table class="facts" style="width:100%;">
            <thead>
              <tr style="border-bottom:2px solid var(--line);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);">
                <th style="padding:10px;text-align:left;color:var(--acid);font:.72rem 'IBM Plex Mono';">FACTION</th>
                <th style="padding:10px;text-align:left;color:var(--acid);font:.72rem 'IBM Plex Mono';">TERRITORY</th>
                <th style="padding:10px;text-align:left;color:var(--acid);font:.72rem 'IBM Plex Mono';">ATTITUDE</th>
                <th style="padding:10px;text-align:left;color:var(--acid);font:.72rem 'IBM Plex Mono';">EXCLUSIVE GOODS</th>
                <th style="padding:10px;text-align:left;color:var(--acid);font:.72rem 'IBM Plex Mono';">RIVAL GROUP</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td style="font-weight:700;color:var(--acid);">The Free Vultures</td>
                <td>Crossroads Settlement</td>
                <td><span style="color:#00ffaa;">Neutral</span></td>
                <td>Basic ammo, lockpicks, food/water, stash renting</td>
                <td>Marshland Marauders</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="font-weight:700;color:var(--acid);">Bunker Wardens</td>
                <td>Subterranean Complex 04</td>
                <td><span style="color:#ffaa00;">Guarded</span></td>
                <td>Heavy body armor, 5.45mm military ammo, night-vision</td>
                <td>Rada Outlaws</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="font-weight:700;color:var(--acid);">Mist Ecologists</td>
                <td>Mobile Lab Sector B</td>
                <td><span style="color:#00ffaa;">Neutral</span></td>
                <td>Anomaly Scanners, high-grade filters, Anti-Rad injectors</td>
                <td>Zealot Cults</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="font-weight:700;color:var(--acid);">Gunners Syndicate</td>
                <td>Industrial Train Depot</td>
                <td><span style="color:#ffaa00;">Mercenary</span></td>
                <td>Gun parts, suppressors, high-caliber sniper rifles</td>
                <td>Mudlarks</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="font-weight:700;color:var(--acid);">The Mudlarks</td>
                <td>Sunken Swamplands</td>
                <td><span style="color:#ffaa00;">Cautious</span></td>
                <td>Swamp herbs, medical salves, improvised stealth cloaks</td>
                <td>Gunners</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="font-weight:700;color:var(--acid);">Marshland Marauders</td>
                <td>Highway Blockades</td>
                <td><span style="color:#ff4444;">Hostile</span></td>
                <td>Black-market weapons, stolen military crates (Raid target)</td>
                <td>All Factions</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <h2 id="tiers">Reputation Tiers &amp; Loyalty Rewards</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Tier 1 — Stranger (0–200 Rep):</strong> Access to basic goods and baseline pricing (100% price index).</li>
          <li><strong>Tier 2 — Associate (200–600 Rep):</strong> 10% discount on ammunition and food; unlocks Tier-2 side contracts and regional safehouse access.</li>
          <li><strong>Tier 3 — Trusted Ally (600–1200 Rep):</strong> 20% discount; unlocks military-grade weapon blueprints, rare attachment crates, and AI guard reinforcement in combat.</li>
          <li><strong>Hostile (&lt; -300 Rep):</strong> Sentries open fire on sight; bounty hunters will ambush you on open roads.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 id="next">Related Guides</h2>
        <div class="related-grid">
          <a href="/weapons/"><strong>Weapons &amp; Attachments</strong><br/>Arsenal stats, calibers, and modding slots</a>
          <a href="/maps/"><strong>World Map &amp; Bunkers</strong><br/>Faction checkpoints and radiation hazard zones</a>
          <a href="/guide/scavland-quests-and-contracts/"><strong>Quests &amp; Contracts</strong><br/>How to take high-reward wasteland contracts</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="toc" aria-label="On this page">
        <strong>On this page</strong>
        <a href="#directory">Factions Directory</a>
        <a href="#tiers">Reputation Tiers</a>
        <a href="#next">Related Guides</a>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
